    "systems": "SAEngine practice: IS 1893 (Part 1):2016 Table 9 lists 'steel concentric braced frame' without OCBF/SCBF; it is taken as SCBF (the stricter rules), overridable; eccentric braced frames are not in IS 800:2007 Section 12 as SAEngine reads it (not covered)",
